  Slug: impersonator-android
  DisplayName: Impersonator Android
  IconPath: systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/heritage.svg
  Description: Your body was augmented with processes and an appearance intended
    to blend in with humans more easily. You become trained in Deception (or another
    skill if you're already trained in Deception). You don't require a disguise kit
    when attempting Deception checks to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Impersonate]
    a human. In addition, you gain a +4 circumstance bonus to Impersonate checks
    to pretend that you're a human version of yourself, rather than an android. This
    bonus doesn't apply to other checks to Impersonate humans.
  SourceTitle: Pathfinder Lost Omens Ancestry Guide
